+  /*
+   * Decryption (ps5webkit): RAR 3.x's AES-128. After a main header with
+   * MHD_PASSWORD each header is an 8-byte salt and the header, padded to 16
+   * bytes, decrypted whole into hbuf; the password is the one whose header
+   * CRC holds. A file's data is one stream across its volumes (a volume can
+   * end inside a block), read through dbuf; per volume, bytes_remaining
+   * counts the plain text that volume completes.
